closest to the north of the lavahole(to be confirmed)?\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tTry to keep using area runes to kill them off when killing <a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a>. Use <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bomb</a> on self, and as long as you don't move and stand in the middle of the fire, it can't reach you.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Frogs\">Frogs</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Azure%20Frog\">Azure Frog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bog%20Frog\">Bog Frog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coral%20Frog\">Coral Frog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crimson%20Frog\">Crimson Frog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Filth%20Toad\">Filth Toad</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Frog\">Green Frog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Holy%20Bog%20Frog\">Holy Bog Frog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernal%20Frog\">Infernal Frog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orchid%20Frog\">Orchid Frog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Frog%20Prince\">The Frog Prince</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Toad\">Toad</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[]}